---
import SectionPhoto from './SectionPhoto.astro';
---
<section class="local section" id="visit" aria-labelledby="local-title">
  <div class="reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Based in Scarborough</p>
    <h2 id="local-title">Your Scarborough<br /><em>manicure appointment.</em></h2>
    <SectionPhoto photo="red" caption="A little inspiration for your next visit." aspect="wide" />
  </div>
  <div class="local__body reveal">
    <p class="local__lead">La La Land Nail Hub is a Scarborough nail studio offering European-style dry manicures, gel colour and structured gel with Bianca Ashley.</p>
    <p>Visiting from Pickering, Ajax, Whitby or elsewhere in Durham Region or the GTA? Your appointment takes place at the Scarborough studio.</p>
    <p>Request an available weekday block between 10 a.m. and 1 p.m.; each block lasts two hours and finishes by 3 p.m. Confirm your appointment and visit details with Bianca before travelling.</p>
    <ul class="local__areas" aria-label="Clients welcome from"><li>Scarborough</li><li>Pickering</li><li>Ajax</li><li>Whitby</li><li>Durham Region</li><li>Greater Toronto Area</li></ul>
    <a class="text-link" href="#booking">Request a Scarborough appointment <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
</section>
